{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16204270","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16204270","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1620427001:1":{"text":"大魔法师在满月时离开，半个月回来的那天是月末或是月初，夜空不具备明亮的月光。","source_cn":"大魔法师在满月时离开，半个月回来的那天是月末或是月初，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA6426C3E4868E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1620427002:1":{"text":"因此，宝石在那天不会发光，年幼的学生才会看不清。而说借着月光看到另一个人偷走宝石的学生，则说了谎。","source_cn":"因此，宝石在那天不会发光，年幼的学生才会看不清。而说借...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65B437838E082A1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620427003:1":{"text":"至于他说谎的原因，自然是为了掩盖自己偷窃宝石的真相。","source_cn":"至于他说谎的原因，自然是为了掩盖自己偷窃宝石的真相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB03FAD0516A586FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620427004:1":{"text":"年长的学生说了谎，以掩盖自己偷窃宝石的真相。他是真凶。","source_cn":"年长的学生说了谎，以掩盖自己偷窃宝石的真相。他是真凶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6718833753C57485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"旁白","source":"旁白","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}